.TH TIMER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Timer \- A countdown in seconds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct Timer { float left; bool running; } Timer;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A countdown in seconds. Pointer\-free, so it may live in GameState (a spawn timer, an invulnerability window) or in a scene static (a "press start" blink). Start with timer_start(), advance with timer_tick() once per update; the tick that reaches zero returns true exactly once.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B left
seconds remaining
.TP
.B running
true between timer_start() and expiry
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timer_start (3),
.BR timer_tick (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
